{"id":"reference/Assembly","kind":"langref","title":"汇编","sourceUrl":"https://ziglang.org/documentation/0.17.0/#Assembly","file":"reference/Assembly.json","headings":[{"depth":2,"slug":"Assembly","text":"汇编"},{"depth":3,"slug":"Output-Constraints","text":"输出约束"},{"depth":3,"slug":"Input-Constraints","text":"输入约束"},{"depth":3,"slug":"Clobbers","text":"破坏声明"},{"depth":3,"slug":"Global-Assembly","text":"全局汇编"}],"html":"<h2 id=\"Assembly\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Assembly/#Assembly\">汇编</a></h2>\n\n      <p>某些场景需要直接控制 Zig 程序生成的机器码，而不能依赖 Zig 的代码生成。此时可以使用内联汇编。以下示例在 x86_64 Linux 上使用内联汇编实现 Hello, World：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">inline_assembly.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">main</span>() <span class=\"tok-type\">noreturn</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> msg = <span class=\"tok-str\">\"hello world\\n\"</span>;\n    _ = syscall3(SYS_write, STDOUT_FILENO, <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@intFromPtr</span>(msg), msg.len);\n    _ = syscall1(SYS_exit, <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>);\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">unreachable</span>;\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> SYS_write = <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>;\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> SYS_exit = <span class=\"tok-number\">60</span>;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> STDOUT_FILENO = <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">syscall1</span>(number: <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span>, arg1: <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span>) <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">asm</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">volatile</span> (<span class=\"tok-str\">\"syscall\"</span>\n        : [ret] <span class=\"tok-str\">\"={rax}\"</span> (-&gt; <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span>),\n        : [number] <span class=\"tok-str\">\"{rax}\"</span> (number),\n          [arg1] <span class=\"tok-str\">\"{rdi}\"</span> (arg1),\n        : .{ .rcx = <span class=\"tok-null\">true</span>, .r11 = <span class=\"tok-null\">true</span> });\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">syscall3</span>(number: <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span>, arg1: <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span>, arg2: <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span>, arg3: <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span>) <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">asm</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">volatile</span> (<span class=\"tok-str\">\"syscall\"</span>\n        : [ret] <span class=\"tok-str\">\"={rax}\"</span> (-&gt; <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span>),\n        : [number] <span class=\"tok-str\">\"{rax}\"</span> (number),\n          [arg1] <span class=\"tok-str\">\"{rdi}\"</span> (arg1),\n          [arg2] <span class=\"tok-str\">\"{rsi}\"</span> (arg2),\n          [arg3] <span class=\"tok-str\">\"{rdx}\"</span> (arg3),\n        : .{ .rcx = <span class=\"tok-null\">true</span>, .r11 = <span class=\"tok-null\">true</span> });\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig build-exe inline_assembly.zig -target x86_64-linux</kbd>\n$ <kbd>./inline_assembly</kbd>\nhello world\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>语法解析如下：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">Assembly Syntax Explained.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">syscall1</span>(number: <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span>, arg1: <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span>) <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 内联汇编是会返回一个值的表达式。</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 表达式由 `asm` 关键字开始。</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">asm</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// `volatile` 是可选修饰符，用来告知 Zig 此</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 内联汇编表达式具有副作用。如果没有</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// `volatile`，当结果未使用时，Zig 可以删除</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 该内联汇编代码。</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">volatile</span> (\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 接下来是包含汇编代码的编译时字符串。</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 如果使用了寄存器约束字符串，在需要寄存器的位置，</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 可以在字符串中使用 `%[ret]`、`%[number]`</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 或 `%[arg1]`，指定 Zig 为参数或返回值</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 使用的寄存器。不过，</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 下方代码没有使用这一方式。字面量 `%` 可以</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 用两个百分号转义得到：`%%`。</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 此处多行字符串语法通常很有用。</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-str\">\\\\syscall</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 接下来是输出。未来 Zig 是否支持</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 多个输出，取决于</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-comment\">// https://github.com/ziglang/zig/issues/215 的解决方式。</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 允许没有输出；此时这个冒号后面会</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 直接跟随表示输入的冒号。</span>\n        :\n        <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 这里指定在上述汇编字符串的 `%[ret]` 语法中</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 使用的名称。本例没有使用它，</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 但语法要求必须提供。</span>\n          [ret]\n          <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 接下来是输出约束字符串。此功能在 Zig 中</span>\n          <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 仍视为不稳定，因此必须参考 LLVM/GCC 文档</span>\n          <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 理解语义。</span>\n          <span class=\"tok-comment\">// http://releases.llvm.org/10.0.0/docs/LangRef.html#inline-asm-constraint-string</span>\n          <span class=\"tok-comment\">// https://gcc.gnu.org/onlinedocs/gcc/Extended-Asm.html</span>\n          <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 本例中，约束字符串的意思是“此内联汇编指令</span>\n          <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 的结果值就是 $rax 中的内容”。</span>\n          <span class=\"tok-str\">\"={rax}\"</span>\n          <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 接下来是值绑定，或者 `-&gt;` 后跟类型。</span>\n          <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 该类型就是内联汇编表达式的结果类型。</span>\n          <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 如果是值绑定，则使用 `%[ret]` 语法</span>\n          <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 引用绑定到该值的寄存器。</span>\n          (-&gt; <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span>),\n          <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 接下来是输入列表。</span>\n          <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 这些输入约束的意思是：“执行汇编代码时，</span>\n          <span class=\"tok-comment\">// $rax 应具有 `number` 的值，$rdi 应具有</span>\n          <span class=\"tok-comment\">// `arg1` 的值”。允许任意数量的输入参数，</span>\n          <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 也可以没有输入参数。</span>\n        : [number] <span class=\"tok-str\">\"{rax}\"</span> (number),\n          [arg1] <span class=\"tok-str\">\"{rdi}\"</span> (arg1),\n          <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 接下来是破坏声明列表，用来声明一组寄存器，</span>\n          <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 它们的值在执行汇编后不保证保留。</span>\n          <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 不包括输入或输出寄存器。特殊的破坏声明值</span>\n          <span class=\"tok-comment\">// \"memory\" 表示汇编会写入任意未声明的</span>\n          <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 内存位置，而不仅仅是已声明的间接</span>\n          <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 输出所指向的内存。本例列出 $rcx 和 $r11，</span>\n          <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 因为已知内核系统调用不会保留这些寄存器。</span>\n        : .{ .rcx = <span class=\"tok-null\">true</span>, .r11 = <span class=\"tok-null\">true</span> });\n}</code></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>对于 x86 和 x86_64 目标，使用 AT&amp;T 语法，而不是更常见的 Intel 语法。这源于技术限制：汇编解析由 LLVM 提供，而其 Intel 语法支持存在缺陷，也未经过充分测试。</p>\n      <p>Zig 将来可能拥有自己的汇编器，以便更紧密地融入语言，并兼容常见的 NASM 语法。在发布 1.0.0 之前，本节文档将更新，明确说明 AT&amp;T 与 Intel/NASM 语法的最终支持状态。</p>\n      <h3 id=\"Output-Constraints\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Assembly/#Output-Constraints\">输出约束</a></h3>\n\n      <p>Zig 中的输出约束仍视为不稳定功能，因此必须参考 <a href=\"http://releases.llvm.org/10.0.0/docs/LangRef.html#inline-asm-constraint-string\">LLVM 文档</a>和 <a href=\"https://gcc.gnu.org/onlinedocs/gcc/Extended-Asm.html\">GCC 文档</a>理解其语义。</p>\n      <p>注意，<a href=\"https://github.com/ziglang/zig/issues/215\">议题 #215</a> 计划对输出约束做出一些破坏性修改。</p>\n      \n\n      <h3 id=\"Input-Constraints\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Assembly/#Input-Constraints\">输入约束</a></h3>\n\n      <p>Zig 中的输入约束仍视为不稳定功能，因此必须参考 <a href=\"http://releases.llvm.org/10.0.0/docs/LangRef.html#inline-asm-constraint-string\">LLVM 文档</a>和 <a href=\"https://gcc.gnu.org/onlinedocs/gcc/Extended-Asm.html\">GCC 文档</a>理解其语义。</p>\n      <p>注意，<a href=\"https://github.com/ziglang/zig/issues/215\">议题 #215</a> 计划对输入约束做出一些破坏性修改。</p>\n      \n\n      <h3 id=\"Clobbers\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Assembly/#Clobbers\">破坏声明</a></h3>\n\n      <p>破坏声明是执行汇编代码后不保证保留值的寄存器集合，不包括输入或输出寄存器。特殊的破坏声明值 <code><span class=\"tok-str\">\"memory\"</span></code> 表示汇编会写入任意未声明的内存位置，而不仅仅是已声明的间接输出所指向的内存。</p>\n      <p>未完整声明某个内联汇编表达式的全部破坏项，属于不进行检查的<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Illegal-Behavior/#Illegal-Behavior\">非法行为</a>。</p>\n      \n\n      <h3 id=\"Global-Assembly\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Assembly/#Global-Assembly\">全局汇编</a></h3>\n\n      <p>汇编表达式出现在<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Namespace/#Namespace\">命名空间</a>级的 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/comptime/#comptime\">comptime</a> 块中时，称为<strong>全局汇编</strong>。</p>\n      <p>这种汇编的规则与内联汇编不同。首先，<code><span class=\"tok-kw\">volatile</span></code> 无效，因为所有全局汇编都会无条件包含。其次，没有输入、输出或破坏声明。所有全局汇编都逐字拼接成一个长字符串，再一起汇编。它不像内联汇编表达式那样具有关于 <code>%</code> 的模板替换规则。</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_global_assembly.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> std = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>);\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expectEqual = std.testing.expectEqual;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">comptime</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">asm</span> (\n        <span class=\"tok-str\">\\\\.global my_func;</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-str\">\\\\.type my_func, @function;</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-str\">\\\\my_func:</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-str\">\\\\  lea (%rdi,%rsi,1),%eax</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-str\">\\\\  retq</span>\n    );\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">extern</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">my_func</span>(a: <span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span>, b: <span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span>) <span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span>;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"global assembly\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">46</span>, my_func(<span class=\"tok-number\">12</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">34</span>));\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_global_assembly.zig -target x86_64-linux -fllvm</kbd>\n1/1 test_global_assembly.test.global assembly...OK\nAll 1 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      \n      \n\n      ","translation":{"total":64,"translated":64}}
